WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
Ryu falls after the prerequisite heavy wind Spire.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.100
Lily performs light Condor Wind during the knockdown.

3
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.350
Crouching light kick links into the standing jabs.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.350
Wind-enhanced medium Condor Spire spends the gained stock.

5
00:00:03.350 --> 00:00:03.700
Ryu falls again after the low-light conversion.
